      "message": "fix(xtask): warn when the gate base branch is behind its remote\n\nThe quick and heavy tiers diff against the local base branch (default\nmain). A worktree agent never pulls the main checkout (#1201), so that\nbranch can be far behind, and the quick gate falls back to batch.\n\nchanged_since now prints one warning for each of upstream/<base> and\norigin/<base> that has commits the local branch lacks, with the count and\nthe --base to use. The plan does not change.\n\nFixes #3739\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
